<Base title="Privacy" description="How Tomebound Tactics handles player data: no location, no patron data, no chat.">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated: 11 November 2026. This policy describes how Tomebound Tactics is designed to handle data. The game is in development; this policy will be updated before launch, and the update will be noted here.</p>

  <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Location.</strong> No player location is collected, stored, or displayed, ever.</li>
      <li><strong>Library and patron data.</strong> No library-card information and no patron data is collected, by the game or on a library's behalf.</li>
      <li><strong>Chat content.</strong> The game has no free-text chat, so there is no chat content to collect.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2>What we do collect, and why</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Account information</strong> needed to sign in and keep your wizards and studies attached to your account.</li>
    <li><strong>Game data</strong> — your wizards, their levels and skills, and your study ledger — which is the game itself. Your study history is yours; it is never sold.</li>
    <li><strong>Purchase records</strong> for cosmetics, processed by the app store (Apple or Google). We do not see or store your payment card details.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>Your game data is not sold and is not shared with advertisers. Sponsored titles in the game are labelled as sponsored; sponsors do not receive player data.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You may ask for a copy of your account data or for your account to be deleted by writing to <strong><a href="mailto:castspells@tomeboundtactics.com">castspells@tomeboundtactics.com</a></strong>. Deleting an account removes its wizards and study history.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Tomebound is designed for readers. School use follows its own policy, which is under separate review; the public-library pilot covers public libraries only.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy: <strong><a href="mailto:castspells@tomeboundtactics.com">castspells@tomeboundtactics.com</a></strong>.</p>
</Base>
